------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This challenge featured a PCAP which showed an attackers Enumeration, and eventual exploitation of a web servers poor xml sanitation. 

The attacker utilized XXE Injections to allow the server's XML parsing to read system files.

This lead to the attacker stealing credentials, having system access and gaining persitence via web shell.

